    "start": 0,
    "text": "// @8bitscript/plus4 — Commodore Plus/4: TED registers, not VIC-II."
  },
  {
    "kind": "comment",
    "length": 71,
    "start": 68,
    "text": "// TED is video, sound, timers, keyboard latch and ROM banking at once."
  },
  {
    "kind": "comment",
    "length": 66,
    "start": 140,
    "text": "// Screen is a 2K block: attributes at $0800, characters at $0C00."
  },
  {
    "kind": "comment",
    "length": 62,
    "start": 207,
    "text": "// Color byte: bits 0-3 chroma, 4-6 luma, 7 blink. 121 colors."
  },
  {
    "kind": "comment",
    "length": 59,
